# Forge server rules

- Persist generations/runs/traces in SQLite via `src/smith/db/smith-db.ts`.
- LLM only through `src/smith/llm/client.ts` (AgentRouter heal → OpenAI-compatible).
- Mutations must change real architecture fields (prompt/tool/memory/router), not UI-only state.
- Errors: throw typed errors with actionable messages; never swallow into empty scores.
